    "title": "One time star and All-American logs career-low snaps: Will he be around in 2026? - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Zach Lentz ,\n7 hours ago For a receiver who once felt like the future of Clemson’s passing game, Tyler Brown is spending a lot of time watching it from the sideline. The sophomore wideout, who burst onto the scene as a true freshman in 2023, has seen his snap count crater over the last month. As Clemson continues to search for a steady offensive rhythm, one of its most electric playmakers has quietly become a bit player. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
